          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Contact the helpline"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003ERaise a \u003Cstrong\u003EContact us\u003C/strong\u003E request from the home page, or telephone the schools\u0027 helpline during opening hours. Include your DfE number so we can find your school\u0027s records.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Common issues"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003ESign-in problems, missing school records, and unexpected performance figures are the three most common tickets. Check the guidance before raising a helpline request.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Security advice"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003EFollow DfE security guidance when handling pupil-level data. Do not share your sign-in credentials and only access the service from a trusted device.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "DSI roles and permissions"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003EThe service uses two DfE Sign-In roles: \u003Cstrong\u003Ecypmd_content_access_user\u003C/strong\u003E for content editors and \u003Cstrong\u003Ecypmd_admin\u003C/strong\u003E for administrators. Admin implies editor.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Rules engine snapshot"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003EThe rules engine picks jobs off a Postgres queue, evaluates them against a versioned rules snapshot pulled from Azure Blob Storage, and writes a decision back to the change request.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Data pipeline overview"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003ERequests flow from the web app into a Postgres queue, are processed by the rules engine worker, and matched decisions raise a Zendesk ticket via the outbox.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Getting started"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003ESign in with your DfE Sign-In account. Once signed in you can view your school\u0027s provisional performance data and submit amendments while the checking window is open.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Submit an amendment"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003EOpen the record you want to change, click \u003Cstrong\u003EAmend\u003C/strong\u003E, describe what should change and why, then submit. You will be notified by email when a reviewer picks it up.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
    "kind": "region",
    "layout": "single",
    "columns": [
      [
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "heading",
          "props": {
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Frequently asked questions"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "widget",
          "type": "richtext",
          "props": {
            "html": "\u003Cp\u003ECommon questions about account access, the checking exercise and the amendment process. Try the search box on the top of this page if you cannot find your question.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    ]
  }
]

[
  {
